# 默认仅允许审定的公开目录；不要强制暂存现场资料。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/panel/
!/docs/
!/scripts/
!/.github/
/.github/*
!/.github/workflows/
/.github/workflows/*
!/.github/workflows/check.yml
/panel/*
!/panel/.gitignore
!/panel/README.md
!/panel/manage.py
!/panel/requirements.txt
!/panel/requirements-lock.txt
!/panel/frontend/
/panel/frontend/dist/
!/panel/requirements-dev.txt
!/panel/requirements-metering.txt
!/panel/portal/
!/panel/megabox/
!/panel/bridge/
!/panel/tests/
/docs/*
!/docs/public/
!/docs/panel/
/docs/panel/*
!/docs/panel/USER_OUTCOME_PLAN_20261001.md
/scripts/*
!/scripts/public/

# 即使位于公开目录也不纳入运行材料和秘密。
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pyc
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*
*.db
*.db-*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.token
*.log
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
config.runtime*.json

# 协议生成代码来源/许可尚未补齐，留本机核验后再公开。
/panel/bridge/proto/
